			<heading>
				Elihu Extols God’s Greatness
			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">And Elihu continued , and said :</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">for I have yet something to say on God’s behalf .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">and ascribe<crossref let="p" cid="c18036003.2" />righteousness to my<crossref let="q" cid="c18036003.3" />Maker .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">one who is<crossref let="r" cid="c18036004.1" />perfect in knowledge is with you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">he is<crossref let="t" cid="c18036005.2" />mighty in strength of understanding .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">but gives<crossref let="u" cid="c18036006.1" />the afflicted their right .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">he sets them forever , and they are<crossref let="x" cid="c18036007.3" />exalted .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">and caught in the cords of affliction ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">and their transgressions , that they are<crossref let="z" cid="c18036009.1" />behaving arrogantly .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">and commands that they<crossref let="b" cid="c18036010.2" />return from iniquity .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and their years in pleasantness .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">and die<crossref let="f" cid="c18036012.2" />without knowledge .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">they do not cry for help when he<crossref let="h" cid="c18036013.2" />binds them .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">and their life ends among the cult prostitutes .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">and<crossref let="k" cid="c18036015.2" />opens their ear by adversity .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">and what was set on your<crossref let="m" cid="c18036016.2" />table was full of<crossref let="n" cid="c18036016.3" />fatness .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">judgment and justice seize you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">and let not the greatness of<crossref let="o" cid="c18036018.1" />the ransom turn you aside .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">or all the force of your strength ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">when peoples vanish<crossref let="r" cid="c18036020.2" />in their place .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">for this you have chosen rather than affliction .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">who is<crossref let="t" cid="c18036022.1" />a teacher like him ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">or who can say ,<crossref let="v" cid="c18036023.2" />‘ You have done wrong ’ ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036024">
			</marker>
			<v n="24">of which men have<crossref let="x" cid="c18036024.2" />sung .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036025">
			</marker>
			<v n="25">man beholds it from afar .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036026">
			</marker>
			<v n="26">the number of his<crossref let="z" cid="c18036026.2" />years is unsearchable .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036027">
			</marker>
			<v n="27">they distill his<crossref let="a" cid="c18036027.1" />mist in<crossref let="b" cid="c18036027.2" />rain ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036028">
			</marker>
			<v n="28">and drop on mankind abundantly .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036029">
			</marker>
			<v n="29">the thunderings of his<crossref let="e" cid="c18036029.2" />pavilion ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036030">
			</marker>
			<v n="30">and covers the roots of the sea .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036031">
			</marker>
			<v n="31">he gives<crossref let="g" cid="c18036031.2" />food in abundance .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036032">
			</marker>
			<v n="32">and commands it to strike the mark .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036033">
			</marker>
			<v n="33">the cattle also declare that he rises .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v18036034">
			</marker>
